sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Browser user
  participant Nginx as nginx
  participant App as n50-dashboard / n50-dashboard-stage
  participant Redis as redis
  participant PG as postgres
  participant Upstream as proxied APIs

  User->>Nginx: GET /n50/... or /n50-stage/...
  Nginx->>App: forward SPA / app request
  App-->>User: HTML + assets + same-origin shell

  User->>Nginx: GET /auth/session or /v1/overview
  Nginx->>App: same-origin API request
  App->>Redis: session / snapshot lookup
  alt snapshot hit or session hit
    Redis-->>App: cached value
    App-->>User: fast response with freshness headers
  else cache miss
    App->>PG: query read model / snapshot source tables
    PG-->>App: rows / aggregates
    App->>Redis: cache session or snapshot
    App-->>User: response
  end

  User->>Nginx: GET /api/v1/intraday/... or /option-chain/api/latest
  Nginx->>App: proxy if /api/v1/*
  App->>Upstream: forward request to export/intraday/reco API
  Upstream->>PG: read from postgres
  Upstream-->>App: proxied JSON
  App-->>User: same-origin JSON

  User->>Nginx: GET /option-chain/api/latest
  Nginx->>Upstream: direct proxy to option-chain watcher
  Upstream->>PG: read latest chain state
  Upstream-->>User: JSON
